I.. ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION OF ITEMS TO BE DISCUSSED IN CLOSED SESSION

b.. CONFERENCE WITH LEGAL COUNSEL (ANTICIPATED LITIGATION)
(Government Code Section 54956.9(d)(2) and (e)(5))

A point has been reached where, in the opinion of the City Council on the advice of its City Attorney, based on existing facts and circumstances, there is a significant exposure to litigation against the City. Pursuant to Government Code Section 54957.5, a record of such threat of litigation is included within the agenda packet which is available for public inspection upon request at the City Clerk's Office at City Hall, 1400 Highland Avenue, Manhattan Beach, CA. prior to the Council Meeting. 

Number of Cases: 1


II.. RECESS INTO CLOSED SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 5:02 PM, the City Council recessed into Closed Session.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


III.. RECONVENE INTO OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 6:40PM, the City Council reconvened into Open Session with all City Councilmembers present. \i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


IV.. CLOSED SESSION ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\i\fs22 City Attorney Barrow announced that the City Council went into Closed Session to discuss two separate items identified on the agenda. The City Council gave direction with respect to both items. There was no reportable action taken. \i0\fs24\par
\pard\cf1\fs22\par
}


G.. ADJOURNMENT {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 6:41 PM, Mayor Howorth adjourned the meeting.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


